TI  - Accessory spleen originating from the intrinsic muscularis of the stomach misdiagnosed as gastrointestinal stromal tumor: a case report.
AU  - Zhang, Jing
AU  - Zhong, Jin-Wei
AU  - Lu, Guang-Rong
AU  - Zhou, Yu-Hui
AU  - Xue, Zhan-Xiong
AU  - Ye, Meng-Si
